1
00:00:00,259 --> 00:00:02,188
Ertalab juda sekin harakat qilaman deb o‘ylaysizmi?

2
00:00:02,188 --> 00:00:03,637
Unda Venera bilan tanishing!

3
00:00:03,637 --> 00:00:07,735
U o‘z o‘qi atrofida bir marta aylanishi uchun 243 Yer kuni kerak!

4
00:00:07,938 --> 00:00:11,261
Quyosh atrofida aylanib chiqishiga esa bor-yo‘g‘i 225 kun ketadi!

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,149
Ha, uning bir marta to‘liq aylanishi

6
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:15,577
butun bir yilidan ham uzoqroq davom etadi!

7
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:18,692
Bu “at a snail’s pace”, ya’ni shilliqqurt tezligida!

8
00:00:18,692 --> 00:00:21,103
Ma’nosi: juda sekin, imillab.

9
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:25,826
Keyingi safar do‘stingiz “Deyarli yetib keldim!” desa,

10
00:00:25,886 --> 00:00:28,833
so‘rang: “Yer vaqti bilanmi... yoki Venera vaqti bilanmi?”
